{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/19/photo_3-thumb.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/19/photo_4-thumb.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ、すべりこみ。よしっ\nこんばんは\nん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短くても書きます\nほんまは毎日、更新したいのに\n全然できてなかって\n自分がめっちゃ情けなくなりました。\n( ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例の鳥さんです\nもう、この子は、一目惚れでした。\n素敵なんですよ\nちょっとふてぶてしい顔してる所とか\n羽がチクチクしてる所とか…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま一番のお気に入り！\nテレビ台に大事に飾ってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、むぎ太くん\nななが小さい時からずっと一緒に過ごしてきた\n悪いこといっぱいするけど\n寂しがりやなななには大きい存在！\nおじいさんやけど\nまだまだ元気やね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nかずみさんが隣でゲームしてて\n「なーちゃんやる？」\nと言われたので、軽い気持ちでやってみた。\nら……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むずっ\nなにこれめっちゃむずいやん！\nできひーん！\nかずみさんさっきまで何食わぬ顔で\n普通に出来てたのに\nこんなにむずかったんか(　ﾟдﾟ ；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、れなりんも挑戦したけど\nななと同様できてなくて\nむちゃくちゃにボタンを連打してました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ\nまりかが、小魚を好んでくれました！\n2人でバリバリ食べたよ\nうんうん。\n分かってくれると思ってたよえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい\nバイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}